  <p id="c-nanshi-033-zhengxianzhi:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-033-zhengxianzhi:p001:m0000" ref="gcu_93j_y97_A">鄭鮮之</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-033-zhengxianzhi:p001:m0004" ref="gcu_93j_y97_A">道子</persName>，滎陽開封人，魏將作大匠渾之玄孫也。祖襲，大司農，經為江乘令，因居縣境。父<persName id="c-nanshi-033-zhengxianzhi:p001:m0043" ref="gcu_93j_y97">遵</persName>，尚書郎。</p>
</text>
